Structure
project/
├── index.html
├── css/style.css
├── js/main.js
└── images/
HTML

Use semantic tags: <header> <main> <section> <footer> <nav>
Always include alt on images
Link CSS in <head>, JS before </body>

CSS

Define all colors, fonts, spacing as CSS variables in :root
Mobile-first: base styles for mobile, expand with @media (min-width: ...)
Layout with Flexbox or Grid — no float, no !important
Spacing in multiples of 4px/8px — no magic numbers

JavaScript

Vanilla JS only — no jQuery
Always const/let, never var
No inline onclick="" — attach listeners in JS
Wrap code in DOMContentLoaded

Git

One commit = one change
Meaningful messages only: Add mobile nav not fix
Always .gitignore: node_modules/, .DS_Store

Never

position: absolute for page layout
Fixed height on blocks — use min-height or padding
Duplicate styles — extract to variable or class
!important